  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Northwest Distribution Network Modernization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aligned with the following impacts: (i) a reliable and efficient power distribution system for a transitioning high-income country established and (ii) sustainable and improved disaster- and climate-resilient infrastructure developed. The project will have the following outcome: quality, efficiency, reliability, and resilience of the power distribution system in the northwest region (Rajshahi and Rangpur) improved.</narrative>
  </description>
